yonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Balakan city.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Balakan_city.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}